Changes: select 200 distinct test utterances per language using SHA-256 of
source row IDs; retain utterance text and intent label vocabulary; remove
annotation/worker fields; group into batches of eight. Selection is performed
before inference and is independent of model output. Exact parquet source
hashes are in source.json. Reproduce with prepare_family_holdout.py.

These fixtures measure native/Fastino implementation agreement, not accuracy
against gold labels, and make no claim about checkpoint training data.
